{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A chaotic couch co-op loot-packing game where you and your friends craft magical items, pack lootboxes, and ship them out before the factory falls apart around you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Artifactory</strong>, the world\u2019s most questionably managed lootbox factory. Your job? Use the resources arriving on conveyor belts to craft magical loot, pack it into lootboxes, and send it off before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, experiment with strange ingredients, and turn chaos into legendary loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/480b9c5f18ab4e61a8932c895561696a.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/480b9c5f18ab4e61a8932c895561696a.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/480b9c5f18ab4e61a8932c895561696a.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Couch Co-op Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with <strong>up to 4 players in local couch co-op</strong>. Coordinate your actions, divide tasks, and try not to sabotage each other while the factory spirals into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/17fc9c9f0fb77042f050109082451f34.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/17fc9c9f0fb77042f050109082451f34.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/17fc9c9f0fb77042f050109082451f34.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft Magical Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions, forge weapons, enchant gear, and combine strange materials to create valuable loot. Discover recipes, experiment with ingredients, and see what unexpected items you can produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/069e8ec77ea82f289b6e889b5daf023b.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/069e8ec77ea82f289b6e889b5daf023b.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/069e8ec77ea82f289b6e889b5daf023b.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Factory That Constantly Fights Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing in this enchanted workplace runs smoothly. Expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conveyor belts that jam or dump items into lava</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken generators and malfunctioning machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving platforms and tricky hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted workstations and cursed portals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pesky ghosts disrupting your workflow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level introduces new disasters to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/c46ad5d51550cdebf545bb8631c5b890.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/c46ad5d51550cdebf545bb8631c5b890.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/c46ad5d51550cdebf545bb8631c5b890.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Could Possibly Go Wrong?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you\u2019ll also have to deal with the chaos: conveyor belts that jam or lead straight into lava, broken generators, moving platforms, haunted workstations, traps, cursed portals, and pesky ghosts getting in your way at every turn. If you\u2019re not careful, your lootbox might go up in smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/5a129b19fdfe12f585557e27aaf187b3.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/5a129b19fdfe12f585557e27aaf187b3.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/5a129b19fdfe12f585557e27aaf187b3.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expect Lots of Laughs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between the frantic teamwork, unexpected crafting results, and the occasional bonk on the head with a random item, <strong>The Artifactory</strong> creates the kind of hilarious chaos couch co-op games are known for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you keep the world\u2019s most ridiculous factory running smoothly?\u00a0</strong>Probably not. But you\u2019ll have a blast trying.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Flawless Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/7958ca376be8c89c47371758b844aa8866e5fdc9.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Touch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/52333aa50b929de280205e18682f4df62c502542.jpg"},{"name":"Nothing But Legends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/f60dfbec385dcf1561cc9e5975d6e434d0c01ef1.jpg"},{"name":"Epic Only, Please","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/6a9fbea076ea236f49f599166515093d1bdbb006.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectly Packed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/b127547bbe80e9e6b40892297a2cf13b638d7f6b.jpg"},{"name":"Keep him fed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/6c20dcdab3b91b96757e73242685bc44cc56606b.jpg"},{"name":"Everyone\u2019s Hired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/ac03ef9b2328ad6335917ea33e7da1dbaca4161f.jpg"},{"name":"Sir Pumpkinhead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/ea5cf86905aa6cf0be4a3ebb98897063788d82bb.jpg"},{"name":"Chicken Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/2bdcf68ca694c6a637e299b73d5510c5f8510582.jpg"},{"name":"Not on My Watch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511520/bb707a09f3ea3edd8af033b560690d728b578c3f.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3511520?t=1773158431","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773158431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/23b20113ebe0cc75a3d88a69bad3a0db9beb777a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773158431","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/23b20113ebe0cc75a3d88a69bad3a0db9beb777a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773158431","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3729420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join The Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/3902d383e795ff4a580afbd7d9a4cafc.avif?t=1773158431\" width=780 height=225 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A chaotic couch co-op loot-packing game where you and your friends craft magical items, pack lootboxes, and ship them out before the factory falls apart around you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>The Artifactory</strong>, the world\u2019s most questionably managed lootbox factory. Your job? Use the resources arriving on conveyor belts to craft magical loot, pack it into lootboxes, and send it off before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, experiment with strange ingredients, and turn chaos into legendary loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/480b9c5f18ab4e61a8932c895561696a.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/480b9c5f18ab4e61a8932c895561696a.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/480b9c5f18ab4e61a8932c895561696a.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Couch Co-op Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or team up with <strong>up to 4 players in local couch co-op</strong>. Coordinate your actions, divide tasks, and try not to sabotage each other while the factory spirals into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/17fc9c9f0fb77042f050109082451f34.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/17fc9c9f0fb77042f050109082451f34.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/17fc9c9f0fb77042f050109082451f34.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft Magical Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew potions, forge weapons, enchant gear, and combine strange materials to create valuable loot. Discover recipes, experiment with ingredients, and see what unexpected items you can produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/069e8ec77ea82f289b6e889b5daf023b.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/069e8ec77ea82f289b6e889b5daf023b.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/069e8ec77ea82f289b6e889b5daf023b.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Factory That Constantly Fights Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing in this enchanted workplace runs smoothly. Expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conveyor belts that jam or dump items into lava</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broken generators and malfunctioning machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moving platforms and tricky hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted workstations and cursed portals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pesky ghosts disrupting your workflow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level introduces new disasters to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/c46ad5d51550cdebf545bb8631c5b890.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/c46ad5d51550cdebf545bb8631c5b890.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/c46ad5d51550cdebf545bb8631c5b890.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Could Possibly Go Wrong?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you\u2019ll also have to deal with the chaos: conveyor belts that jam or lead straight into lava, broken generators, moving platforms, haunted workstations, traps, cursed portals, and pesky ghosts getting in your way at every turn. If you\u2019re not careful, your lootbox might go up in smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/5a129b19fdfe12f585557e27aaf187b3.poster.avif?t=1773158431\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/5a129b19fdfe12f585557e27aaf187b3.webm?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511520/extras/5a129b19fdfe12f585557e27aaf187b3.mp4?t=1773158431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expect Lots of Laughs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between the frantic teamwork, unexpected crafting results, and the occasional bonk on the head with a random item, <strong>The Artifactory</strong> creates the kind of hilarious chaos couch co-op games are known for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you keep the world\u2019s most ridiculous factory running smoothly?\u00a0</strong>Probably not. But you\u2019ll have a blast trying.</p>","developers":["Berries Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}